      'Two mobs at once, with Frost Nova and Frostbolt, comes closest: about even with one at a time at 50 and 60, within the model\'s 6 to 9% slow bias there, and 9 to 45% slower per kill from 20 to 40. We tested every uncertain number at its low and high, plus a Frost Nova that never breaks and mobs 3 levels below you, and none clearly flips the answer alone. The only pair that clearly does is a Classic-strength chill together with mobs hitting half as hard as we assume: big Blizzard pulls then pay, from 5 to 7 mobs at 40 to 60.',
