        '[ForeverChanges: Mage changes vs Classic](https://foreverchanges.pro/class/mage), talents, spellbook, racials and [patch notes](https://foreverchanges.pro/patch-notes)',
        '[ForeverChanges: downranking](https://foreverchanges.pro/downrank-calculator), with DoubleZug\'s beta measurements at levels 18 and 19',
        '[ElliotWood/Forever sim](https://github.com/ElliotWood/Forever): talent trees, client trait curves, spell data, and the raid cross-check',
        '[Icy Veins: Forever Mage overview](https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-overview)',
        '[Warcraft Tavern: Forever Mage guide](https://www.warcrafttavern.com/forever/guides/mage)',
